<p class="sub-band" style="margin-top:4px">Hybrid dense and sparse retrieval for production RAG</p>
<p>A retrieval pipeline built on LangChain, Llama 3, Elasticsearch and Milvus, blending dense and sparse embeddings with hybrid query strategies rather than committing to either. It reached 89% top-10 retrieval accuracy on Natural Questions, above the benchmarks we were measuring against, and evaluation extended to TREC-COVID and SQuAD using exact match and nDCG at k. Deployment used Ray on GKE for autoscaling and bulk ingestion, which cut ingestion, retrieval and evaluation time by 40% and made iteration cheap enough to actually tune the hybrid weighting.</p>
